# ====== Mau bi mat — copy thanh .env roi dien gia tri that. KHONG commit .env ======
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#   nano .env            # dien 4 gia tri o muc BAT BUOC ben duoi
#   docker compose up -d
#
# Sinh chuoi ngau nhien cho mat khau / khoa:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(48).toString('base64url'))"

# ==================================================================== BAT BUOC
# Bon gia tri nay khong co mac dinh — thieu la `docker compose up` dung ngay.

# Mat khau PostgreSQL trong container. Dat gi cung duoc mien la manh; khong ai
# phai nho vi cong 5432 khong mo ra ngoai.
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=

# Khoa ky JWT. Doi khoa nay = dang xuat toan bo nguoi dung.
JWT_SECRET=

# Mat khau tai khoan admin dau tien (dung cho lenh seed).
ADMIN_MAT_KHAU=

# Dia chi API ma TRINH DUYET va DIEN THOAI goi tới.
#
# CAN THAN: gia tri nay duoc nhung vao ma JavaScript luc BUILD, khong doc luc chay.
# Doi no phai build lai webapp: docker compose up -d --build web
#
#   Chi thu tren chinh may chay Docker   -> http://localhost:8080
#   May khac / dien thoai trong LAN      -> http://192.168.1.10:8080   (IP thuc cua may chu)
#   Da co ten mien + HTTPS               -> https://chamcong.congty.vn
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8080

# Nguon web duoc phep goi API (CORS). Phai khop origin ma nguoi dung mo webapp,
# KHAC voi VITE_API_URL (do la dia chi API). Nhieu gia tri thi phan tach bang dau phay.
#
#   Chay bang Docker      -> http://localhost:8081
#   Trong LAN             -> http://192.168.1.10:8081
#   Vua Docker vua dev    -> http://localhost:8081,http://localhost:5173
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:8081

# IP duoc phep goi /iclock/* (cong may cham cong), phan tach bang dau phay.
# Ho tro CIDR: 203.0.113.45,192.168.1.0/24
#
#   May chu trong LAN kin        -> de TRONG (cho phep tat ca)
#   May chu co dia chi cong khai -> BAT BUOC dien IP cong khai cua van phong
#
# Vi sao khong chan bang tuong lua: cong 8080 con phuc vu /api/* cho dien thoai va may
# nhan su o moi noi, ma tuong lua khong phan biet duong dan. De trong tren may chu cong
# khai = ai biet serial may cung day duoc lan quet gia vao bang cong.
#
# Lay IP cong khai cua van phong: chay `curl -s https://api.ipify.org` tu mot may TRONG
# van phong. Van phong dung IP dong thi xem tai_lieu/TRIEN-KHAI.md.
ICLOCK_IP_CHO_PHEP=

# ==================================================================== API TICH HOP
# Trang tai lieu API o /api/v1/tai-lieu (Swagger UI).
#
# 1 = bat (mac dinh). Trang do chi bay ra HOP DONG — ten duong dan, tham so, y nghia — chu
# khong bay ra du lieu; muon goi that van phai co khoa API. Dua duong dan cho ben tich hop
# la ho tu doc duoc. Dat 0 neu khong muon lo ca hop dong ra Internet.
API_TAI_LIEU_CONG_KHAI=1

# Dia chi CONG KHAI cua API, ghi vao truong `servers` cua spec OpenAPI.
#
# PHAI khai bang tay: may chu nam sau reverse proxy nen khong tu suy ra duoc. Ben ngoai goi
# https://ten-mien/chamcong/api/v1/... nhung ben trong container chi thay /api/v1/... —
# tien to /chamcong do Caddy them vao.
#
# De trong thi bo sinh client mac dinh ve http://localhost va client sinh ra khong goi duoc.
API_GOC_CONG_KHAI=

# ==================================================================== TEN MIEN + HTTPS
# De trong ca khoi nay = chay bang IP va cong nhu mac dinh (web :8081, API :8080).
#
# Dien vao = bat cong vao Caddy: mot ten mien duy nhat phuc vu ca webapp lan API, tu xin
# chung chi Let's Encrypt. Truoc khi bat, ban ghi A cua ten mien PHAI tro san ve IP may
# chu, neu khong Caddy khong xin duoc chung chi.
#
# Hai dong duoi phai bat cung nhau. Chi tiet: tai_lieu/TEN-MIEN.md
#
#   COMPOSE_PROFILES=ten_mien
#   TEN_MIEN=chamcong.congty.vn
#
# CANH BAO khi may chu DA co mot reverse proxy rieng (Caddy/nginx cai truc tiep tren may,
# thuong gap khi ten mien dang phuc vu ca mot dich vu khac):
#
#   -> KHONG bat COMPOSE_PROFILES=ten_mien. Caddy trong compose cung doi cong 80/443, ma
#      proxy cua may chu dang giu roi. Docker khong the cuop cong dang bi chiem nen
#      container `cong_vao` chi don gian la khong khoi dong duoc ("port is already
#      allocated") — dich vu kia van song, nhung `docker compose up` bao loi va lan trien
#      khai coi nhu that bai giua chung.
#
#      Dung cach: de proxy cua may chu dan vao ${CONG_MAY_CHU}/${CONG_WEB}.
#      Xem tai_lieu/TEN-MIEN.md muc 2b.
#
# Van nen dien TEN_MIEN du khong bat profile: mot minh no khong khoi dong gi ca, chi de
# trien_khai/cap_nhat_vps.sh biet duong ma kiem tra sau khi cap nhat.
COMPOSE_PROFILES=
TEN_MIEN=

# Tien to duong dan khi dung CHUNG ten mien voi dich vu khac, vd webapp o
# https://teams.congty.vn/chamcong/ thi dat VITE_BASE=/chamcong/
# Phai co dau gach cheo o CA HAI dau. Nhung vao luc build -> doi la phai `up -d --build`.
# Xem tai_lieu/TEN-MIEN.md muc 2b.
VITE_BASE=/

# Dai mang cua reverse proxy duoc phep dat X-Forwarded-For.
#
#   Co cong vao Caddy  -> 172.16.0.0/12   (dai mang noi bo cua Docker)
#   Khong co proxy     -> de TRONG
#
# X-Forwarded-For do client gui len nen ai cung dat gia tri tuy y duoc. Tin no vo dieu
# kien = ICLOCK_IP_CHO_PHEP mat tac dung hoan toan: chi can gui kem IP van phong la qua
# duoc danh sach trang. TUYET DOI khong dien 0.0.0.0/0.
PROXY_TIN_CAY=

# Cong mo ra ngoai may. Dung cong vao Caddy thi khoa hai cong nay lai trong may, moi
# luong vao deu di qua Caddy (co HTTPS, co log tap trung):
#
#   CONG_MAY_CHU=127.0.0.1:8080
#   CONG_WEB=127.0.0.1:8081
CONG_MAY_CHU=8080
CONG_WEB=8081

# ==================================================================== DANG NHAP MICROSOFT
# De trong ca khoi = tat han, chi dang nhap bang mat khau.
# Cach dang ky ung dung ben Entra: tai_lieu/DANG-NHAP-MICROSOFT.md
#
# Thieu MOT trong bon gia tri dau la tinh nang tat, khong chay nua voi.
MS_TENANT_ID=
MS_CLIENT_ID=
MS_CLIENT_SECRET=
# PHAI khop tung ky tu voi Redirect URI khai ben Entra.
MS_REDIRECT_URI=

# Noi chuyen nguoi dung ve sau khi dang nhap xong, vd https://teams.congty.vn/chamcong
MS_GOC_WEBAPP=

# Ten mien email duoc phep tu tao tai khoan, phan tach bang dau phay.
#
#   De TRONG -> chi nguoi da duoc nhan su khai truoc moi dang nhap duoc.
#   Co gia tri -> ai co email thuoc ten mien do deu XAC THUC duoc, he thong tu tao tai khoan
#                 o trang thai CHO DUYET: dang nhap duoc nhung chua vao duoc he thong, cho
#                 toi khi admin phan vai tro. Nguoi ngoai ten mien van bi tu choi.
#
# VD: MS_TEN_MIEN_CHO_PHEP=tranhoangvietnam.com
MS_TEN_MIEN_CHO_PHEP=

# 1 = bo qua buoc duyet, tai khoan tu tao duoc cap luon vai tro nhan_vien.
# 0 (mac dinh) = phai co admin phan quyen moi vao duoc.
MS_TU_DONG_TAO=0

# =============================================== DONG BO SHAREPOINT (thu vien HCNS)
# Day kho tep ho so len thu vien HCNS. MOT CHIEU: may chu la ban goc, SharePoint la ban sao,
# va xoa ben nay thi xoa lan sang ben do. De trong ca khoi = tat han.
#
# DUNG MOT APP RIENG, khong dung lai app dang nhap o tren. Ly do: app dang nhap chi can
# `openid profile email`; gan them quyen ghi tep vao no la mo rong be mat cua chinh lop dang
# nhap. Quyen can la `Sites.Selected` — no CHI co hieu luc tren nhung site duoc cap ten dich
# danh, hep hon `Sites.ReadWrite.All` rat nhieu.
#
# Cach dang ky app va cap quyen tren site: tai_lieu/SHAREPOINT.md
SHAREPOINT_SITE_ID=
# Biet san thi khoi mot luot goi Graph moi lan khoi dong. Khong biet thi de trong.
SHAREPOINT_DRIVE_ID=
SHAREPOINT_THU_VIEN=HCNS
# De trong = dung MS_TENANT_ID.
SHAREPOINT_TENANT_ID=
SHAREPOINT_CLIENT_ID=
SHAREPOINT_CLIENT_SECRET=

# 0 = chi ghi nhan viec can day vao bang, CHUA cham vao SharePoint.
# Bat len sau khi da xem bang do va thay duong dan dung.
SHAREPOINT_BAT_DAY=0

# HAI BIEN DUOI DE TRONG. Chung chi ton tai de bo kiem dung mot may chu Graph gia tai cho —
# phien lam viec viet ma nay khong ket noi duoc SharePoint that. Dat gia tri o day nghia la
# nop client secret cho may chu do tro tay: chinh vi the ma khi NODE_ENV=production, may chu
# TU CHOI moi gia tri khong phai graph.microsoft.com / login.microsoftonline.com.
SHAREPOINT_GOC_GRAPH=
SHAREPOINT_GOC_TOKEN=


# ==================================================================== NGHIEP VU

# Mui gio NOI DAT MAY CHAM CONG. May ZKTeco gui gio dia phuong khong kem offset,
# nen dat sai la lech toan bo gio cong. Viet Nam = 7.
DEVICE_TZ_OFFSET_HOURS=7

# Coi may la OFFLINE neu khong thay tin hieu qua so giay nay. May ZKTeco thuong
# bao hieu moi 30-60 giay, nen 180 la du de khong bao dong gia.
MAY_OFFLINE_SAU_GIAY=180

# Ban kinh geofence mac dinh (met) khi dia diem khong khai rieng.
# GPS trong nha lech 10-50m — dat duoi 100 se luon bao "ngoai pham vi".
GEOFENCE_BAN_KINH_M=200

# ==================================================================== TUY CHON

JWT_ACCESS_TTL=900          # giay — token truy cap (15 phut)
JWT_REFRESH_TTL=2592000     # giay — token lam moi (30 ngay)

ADMIN_TEN_DANG_NHAP=admin

# Dong bo sang ERP. De trong = tat. Neu dien, outbox POST tung su kien len URL nay
# (gom ca canh bao thiet_bi.mat_ket_noi).
ERP_WEBHOOK_URL=
ERP_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# ==================================================================== CHAY KHONG QUA DOCKER
# Ba bien duoi CHI dung khi chay `npm run may_chu` truc tiep tren may.
# Docker compose tu dat gia tri rieng, khong doc phan nay.

DATABASE_URL=postgres://chamcong:chamcong_dev@localhost:5432/chamcong
PORT=8080
NODE_ENV=development
THU_MUC_ANH=./du_lieu/anh_cham_cong

# Ho so nhan su: noi luu hop dong scan, bien ban, anh bien nhan thiet bi.
# Trong Docker day la volume `ho_so` — mat no la mat ban goc, CSDL chi giu sieu du lieu.
THU_MUC_HO_SO=./du_lieu/ho_so
# Kich thuoc mot tep dinh kem toi da (byte). Mac dinh 15 MB.
TEP_TOI_DA_BYTE=15728640
# Kich thuoc anh selfie cham cong toi da (byte). Mac dinh 3 MB. KHAC TEP_TOI_DA_BYTE:
# anh nay do app dien thoai gui len moi lan quet nen phai chat hon nhieu.
ANH_TOI_DA_BYTE=3145728

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- ERP cu
# Dong bo nguoi dung tu he thong ERP Tran Hoang Viet Nam sang day.
# Khoa noi hai ben (va noi voi Microsoft 365) la EMAIL.
#
# De TRONG ERP_API_URL = tat han tinh nang dong bo.
ERP_API_URL=https://tranhoangvn.com/api/v1
# Xac thuc bang header X-Api-Key (KHONG phai Bearer).
# Khoa UAT trong tai lieu dung chung cho ca ba service va KHONG duoc dung o production —
# xin khoa rieng tu team Backend ben ERP.
ERP_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- hop dong dien tu
# vContract (Viettel). De TRONG VCONTRACT_URL = tat han tinh nang ky dien tu.
#   That:  https://hopdongdientu.viettel.vn/scontract-web-api
#   Thu:   https://chungtudientu.viettel.vn/scontract-web-api
VCONTRACT_URL=
VCONTRACT_USERNAME=
VCONTRACT_PASSWORD=
# Ma he thong do Viettel cap khi mo ket noi.
VCONTRACT_CP_CODE=
# VCONTRACT = co chung thuc | SCONTRACT = khong chung thuc. Khai sai thi login duoc nhung
# hop dong vao nham phien ban.
VCONTRACT_CP_ACCOUNT_CODE=VCONTRACT
# Token vContract phai gui trong header Authorization khi goi callback ve day. Sinh bang:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64url'))"
# roi khai cung gia tri do voi Viettel. DE TRONG = tu choi moi callback.
VCONTRACT_TOKEN_CALLBACK=

# Thong bao day toi app dien thoai khi co don moi / don duoc duyet. Dat 0 de tat han:
# huu ich khi may chu khong ra duoc Internet, hoac khi nap lai du lieu cu hang loat.
THONG_BAO_DAY=1
# Dich vu day cua Expo. Chi doi khi tu chay may chu day rieng.
EXPO_PUSH_URL=https://exp.host/--/api/v2/push/send

# Tu dong chay di tru CSDL luc may chu khoi dong. Mac dinh: bat khi phat trien, TAT o
# production — nhung docker-compose.yml dat "1" vi anh Docker luon mang dung ban di tru
# hop voi ma nguon trong no. Dat 0 neu muon tu chay `npm run di_tru` truoc.
TU_DONG_DI_TRU=1
